 "title": "Wimbledon started for lawnmowers",
 "cat": "history",
 "emoji": "🎾",
 "sentences": [
  "Wimbledon started to fix a pony roller.",
  "The All England Croquet Club added tennis in 1875 because croquet interest was fading.",
  "By June 1877, they organized a tournament to pay for lawn maintenance repairs.",
  "22 players paid one guinea each to compete on grass courts.",
  "The final drew 200 spectators, who paid one shilling each.",
  "The winner took home 12 guineas and a silver cup."
